=== Pre-existing environment gap found & worked around (not a NEARS-2158 defect) ===

This worktree's UserApp/android/app/google-services.json is gitignored (like
Admin/.env and product images) and was ABSENT on fresh checkout — native
Firebase init failed ("E FA: Missing google_app_id. Firebase Analytics
disabled.") and a push sent before the fix produced HTTP 200 from Google but
never reached the device (no pid change after 30s poll). Copied the file from
the primary tree (/Users/Apple/Projects/nears/UserApp/android/app/google-services.json,
same project_id=nears-1d39b, same package=com.izzes.nears), rebuilt, and
re-logged-in — after which FCM registration/topic-subscribe completed cleanly
and the push reached the device on the first send. Flagged as a followup
(worktree-bootstrap gap), not a task_bug on this ticket.

